<speak version="1.0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2001/10/synthesis" xml:lang="en-US"><voice name="en-US-AvaMultilingualNeural">Number three.<break time="1350ms"/></voice><voice name="en-CA-ClaraNeural">I can't meet you at the cafe this afternoon. A repair worker is coming to look at our washing machine.<break time="550ms"/></voice><voice name="en-GB-RyanNeural">Didn't your brother say he would stay home for that?<break time="550ms"/></voice><voice name="en-CA-ClaraNeural">He was supposed to, but his manager asked him to work an extra shift. The worker may arrive anytime between two and five.<break time="550ms"/></voice><voice name="en-GB-RyanNeural">No problem. We can meet tomorrow after my class instead.<break time="1300ms"/></voice><voice name="en-US-AvaMultilingualNeural">Question.<break time="350ms"/></voice><voice name="en-US-AvaMultilingualNeural">Why will the woman stay home this afternoon?</voice></speak>
